# The verl fork both images ship: docker/verl/Dockerfile installs it into the
# verl image, docker/rl-integration/Dockerfile copies its source for the
# webhook to inject. Upstream verl 983cb0f2 plus two commits that add the
# fully-async lifecycle hooks and trainer registry the timeslice plugin needs
# (branch feat/fully-async-lifecycle-hooks). Change it here only; a build arg
# of the same name overrides it for one build.
VERL_REPO=https://github.com/aishukamal/verl.git
VERL_COMMIT=976b5f57f7e4872b6fa1aef36a6b6086eedff11c
